Test data: tests/data/shattered-1-prefix.bin

The first 320 bytes of shattered-1.pdf from the SHAttered SHA-1 collision
(Stevens, Bursztein, Karpman, Albertini, Markov; https://shattered.io), as
shipped in the test data of the sha1-checked crate (RustCrypto, MIT OR
Apache-2.0). Used only to check that SHA-1 collision detection is wired up.
